{"data": [{"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2122727905935654917", "3_2122727905931460615", "3_2122727905906298880", "3_2122727905935654913", "3_2122727905948237826", "3_2122727905931460618", "3_2122727905931460609", "3_2122727906753544194", "3_2122727905918943232"]}, "author_id": "1618975370488999936", "created_at": "2026-11-17T16:26:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122727993537888335"], "entities": {"urls": [{"end": 112, "start": 89, "url": "https://t.co/2O8RLKmSYL"}]}, "id": "2122727993537888335", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 1425, "like_count": 9, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122556227486154882", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "A lot happened in AI on November 16.\nHere's your visual recap. 👇 https://t.co/lyiMkS3C49 https://t.co/2O8RLKmSYL", "url": "https://x.com/ai_for_success/status/2122727993537888335"}, {"author_id": "1618975370488999936", "created_at": "2026-11-17T15:40:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122716455175139743"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 153, "id": "2096990866028089344", "start": 142, "username": "VersineApp"}], "urls": [{"end": 303, "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/6uUd17dRwv"}]}, "id": "2122716455175139743", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1513, "like_count": 10, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122713860973150622", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "your AI agent can read a 40-page contract or debug a repo, then still leaves you opening Venmo yourself to split a $50 dinner bill.\n\nVersine (@VersineApp) gives ChatGPT, Claude, Muse, Instinct, or any MCP client a real payment rail inside rules you set. you can cap auto-sends at https://t.co/6uUd17dRwv", "url": "https://x.com/ai_for_success/status/2122716455175139743"}, {"author_id": "1547403906954563585", "created_at": "2026-11-17T15:38:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122716122596478987"], "entities": {"urls": [{"end": 90, "start": 67, "url": "https://t.co/Exz6A6tHFh"}]}, "id": "2122716122596478987", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 8, "impression_count": 3575, "like_count": 49, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122705177203642485", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "yup. my daily usage of antigravity has been going up and up and up https://t.co/Exz6A6tHFh", "url": "https://x.com/WesRoth/status/2122716122596478987"}, {"author_id": "1547403906954563585", "created_at": "2026-11-17T14:26:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122697980465807392"], "id": "2122697980465807392", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 3296, "like_count": 96, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 14, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Astra 6.2\n\ntoday\n\nmaybe", "url": "https://x.com/WesRoth/status/2122697980465807392"}, {"author_id": "1618975370488999936", "created_at": "2026-11-17T14:15:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122695058113864113"], "entities": {"urls": [{"end": 301, "start": 278, "url": "https://t.co/gVQnaYcrCx"}]}, "id": "2122695058113864113", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 1881, "like_count": 16, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 9, "retweet_count": 2}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122318031162647001", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "generative LLMs are way too slow for routine agent decisions because they decode text token by token just to pick a button or decide whether to call a tool. MachinePulse built Karpo Decision 31B to skip token generation and return calibrated option probabilities in one forward https://t.co/gVQnaYcrCx", "url": "https://x.com/ai_for_success/status/2122695058113864113"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2122693427976605697"]}, "author_id": "1547403906954563585", "created_at": "2026-11-17T14:12:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122694284906578125"], "id": "2122694284906578125", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1120, "like_count": 10, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "found this neat little AI competition \"Victris Arena\"\n\nask your favorite AI coding agent to write a bot, then send it into 1v1 fights against other bots on a ranked leaderboard.\n\nwatch the matches, tweak your bot’s strategy, and send it back into the arena https://t.co/x51JIAWmuc", "url": "https://x.com/WesRoth/status/2122694284906578125"}, {"author_id": "1618975370488999936", "created_at": "2026-11-17T13:30:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122683851059364172"], "entities": {"urls": [{"end": 267, "start": 244, "url": "https://t.co/RcGPC5u7Hm"}]}, "id": "2122683851059364172", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 11, "impression_count": 2445, "like_count": 15, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122679837131186372", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "an 800M+ high-intent lead database exposed straight over MCP and API is insane for outbound agents.\n\nImagine the impact when you can just ask for SaaS founders above $3M ARR, and your agent gets the contacts along with the signals that matter. https://t.co/RcGPC5u7Hm", "url": "https://x.com/ai_for_success/status/2122683851059364172"}, {"author_id": "3888491", "created_at": "2026-11-17T13:26:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122682883639005326"], "entities": {"urls": [{"end": 223, "start": 200, "url": "https://t.co/pFDowDgOeR"}]}, "id": "2122682883639005326", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 17, "impression_count": 8641, "like_count": 40, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 9, "retweet_count": 2}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122659481842483378", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Love to see more people understand just how good Chinese cars are. \n\nNext week I’ll be going to China to check out some factories first hand. \n\nMy itch got so hard I just had to go see for myself 💪🏼🫡 https://t.co/pFDowDgOeR", "url": "https://x.com/LinusEkenstam/status/2122682883639005326"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2122617316437577728"]}, "author_id": "1547403906954563585", "created_at": "2026-11-17T11:09:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122648295818604865"], "id": "2122648295818604865", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 1920, "like_count": 28, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 12, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "I had a Gemini 4 Carbon swarm build an entire 8.5-minute 60fps simulation from scratch:\n\nwhat every flyby speed looks like at street level in NYC\n\nfrom 11 km/h (Wright Flyer) to Mach 565 (Parker Solar Probe):\n\n(LOUD)\n\n00:00 Intro\n00:11 Wright Flyer (11 km/h)\n00:40 Fokker Dr.I https://t.co/ABv3WsGHwD", "url": "https://x.com/WesRoth/status/2122648295818604865"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2122644753443606528"]}, "author_id": "1618975370488999936", "created_at": "2026-11-17T10:55:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122644776411599338"], "id": "2122644776411599338", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 2261, "like_count": 15, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 12, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Looking forward to what Microsoft has in store for us today. It's Microsoft Ignite day! Hoping for some exciting announcements! https://t.co/ePUa0N0tv7", "url": "https://x.com/ai_for_success/status/2122644776411599338"}, {"author_id": "1547403906954563585", "created_at": "2026-11-17T08:33:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122609125284876606"], "entities": {"urls": [{"end": 168, "start": 145, "url": "https://t.co/mSt0fGy5Ab"}]}, "id": "2122609125284876606", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 2452, "like_count": 58, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 4}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122076306401542504", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "they do have everything, that's the sad part\n\nit's not the lack of talent that's the problem, but the overabundance of clueless people in charge https://t.co/mSt0fGy5Ab", "url": "https://x.com/WesRoth/status/2122609125284876606"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2122597701397168128", "3_2122597701443268608"]}, "author_id": "3888491", "created_at": "2026-11-17T07:48:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122597708749852768"], "entities": {"urls": [{"end": 322, "start": 299, "url": "https://t.co/ncEUIuSFvY"}]}, "id": "2122597708749852768", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 27, "impression_count": 10036, "like_count": 60, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 26, "retweet_count": 3}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122495555276546461", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "The future of mid-distance travel (1000+ miles) is high speed trains or self-driving vehicles. \n\n(1000-2000 miles) and I bet you get self contained pods, like hotel rooms on wheels, you do overnight mainly, \n\nGo to bed in one place and wake up in the next. \n\nNo more flights https://t.co/sqbYALXviz https://t.co/ncEUIuSFvY", "url": "https://x.com/LinusEkenstam/status/2122597708749852768"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2122596116739051520"]}, "author_id": "1618975370488999936", "created_at": "2026-11-17T07:42:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122596161425113301"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 165, "id": "1966041626897428481", "start": 152, "username": "VivixLabs_HQ"}], "urls": [{"end": 322, "start": 299, "url": "https://t.co/COJuUExFOo"}]}, "id": "2122596161425113301", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 1828, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2121273658010489009", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Testing AI video formats for a new social account usually burns through your budget before you find something that actually sticks.\n\nWith Vivix W1 from @VivixLabs_HQ, you start from an existing reference video, drop in a character reference image, and swap the subject while https://t.co/XQyzNRBl6t https://t.co/COJuUExFOo", "url": "https://x.com/ai_for_success/status/2122596161425113301"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2122456083268509696"], "media_source_tweet_id": ["2122456557602459903"]}, "author_id": "1618975370488999936", "created_at": "2026-11-17T06:54:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122584208006901857"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 74, "id": "759894532649545732", "start": 61, "username": "AravSrinivas"}]}, "id": "2122584208006901857", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 23, "impression_count": 17131, "like_count": 325, "quote_count": 8, "reply_count": 27, "retweet_count": 9}, "text": "Perplexity CEO : We just crossed $1B on ARR \nCongratulations @AravSrinivas bhai. 👏👏  https://t.co/BuPcvQqnP7", "url": "https://x.com/ai_for_success/status/2122584208006901857"}, {"author_id": "6681172", "created_at": "2026-11-17T05:33:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122563881986064773"], "id": "2122563881986064773", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 47, "impression_count": 71497, "like_count": 1706, "quote_count": 19, "reply_count": 153, "retweet_count": 41}, "text": "opus 5.5 is still the best model right now", "url": "https://x.com/MatthewBerman/status/2122563881986064773"}, {"author_id": "1618975370488999936", "created_at": "2026-11-17T05:03:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122556227486154882"], "id": "2122556227486154882", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 3014, "like_count": 20, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 8, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "New edition of AI Compass is live 🧭 (Nov 16)\n\n- Qwen launches 2.4T Qwen4-Max MoE model at $1.5 and $4.5 per million\n- Perplexity launches Monitor API for scheduled web and page webhooks\n- Google rolls out interactive sites from sources in Gemini Notebook\n- California Department", "url": "https://x.com/ai_for_success/status/2122556227486154882"}, {"author_id": "6681172", "created_at": "2026-11-17T04:41:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122550744926851281"], "entities": {"urls": [{"end": 59, "start": 36, "url": "https://t.co/K5UxTTqDgf"}]}, "id": "2122550744926851281", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 14239, "like_count": 86, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 13, "retweet_count": 5}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122533142137614375", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "This is less than a nothing update. https://t.co/K5UxTTqDgf", "url": "https://x.com/MatthewBerman/status/2122550744926851281"}, {"author_id": "1547403906954563585", "created_at": "2026-11-17T04:40:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122550467213566129"], "entities": {"urls": [{"end": 148, "start": 125, "url": "https://t.co/k382qVBqvS"}]}, "id": "2122550467213566129", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 3274, "like_count": 73, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 2}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2121995093204701439", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "these are the most shocking headlines I've seen all year\n\nthey've reported the news honestly... what is the world coming to? https://t.co/k382qVBqvS", "url": "https://x.com/WesRoth/status/2122550467213566129"}, {"author_id": "1547403906954563585", "created_at": "2026-11-17T04:22:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122545987835351386"], "entities": {"urls": [{"end": 55, "start": 32, "url": "https://t.co/BNA9RbkQdg"}]}, "id": "2122545987835351386", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 7, "impression_count": 2947, "like_count": 74, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122016581295509619", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "people are sleeping on Gemini 4 https://t.co/BNA9RbkQdg", "url": "https://x.com/WesRoth/status/2122545987835351386"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2122542369228910592"]}, "author_id": "1547403906954563585", "created_at": "2026-11-17T04:11:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122543167899934887"], "id": "2122543167899934887", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1716, "like_count": 31, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "Parker Solar Probe is the fastest man made object \n\nclocking in at 430,000 mph (692,000 km/h)\n\nhere's what happens if it flies past you on a street\n\n(VERY LOUD)\n\nI'm having a hard time stringing several of these together. made by gemini 4 carbon. https://t.co/wvqNxbcMmV", "url": "https://x.com/WesRoth/status/2122543167899934887"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2122538977035165696"]}, "author_id": "1547403906954563585", "created_at": "2026-11-17T03:58:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122539867381154093"], "id": "2122539867381154093", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 2010, "like_count": 18, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "dang, my other clips got cut off\n\nhere's the International Space Station flying by you on a NY street\n\n27,000 km/h\n\n(LOUD!!)\n\nmade by gemini 4 carbon https://t.co/Du5dEGdZvQ", "url": "https://x.com/WesRoth/status/2122539867381154093"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2122535094762262528"]}, "author_id": "1547403906954563585", "created_at": "2026-11-17T03:52:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122538449362403506"], "id": "2122538449362403506", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 2392, "like_count": 33, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Gemini 4 Carbon recreates what happens if various flying objects fly past you on the street.\n\n(VERY LOUD!!)\n\nstarts with the Wright Brothers plane (30 mph) and ends with NASA's Parker Solar Probe (430,000 mph)\n\nhere's Lockheed SR-71 Blackbird (roughly 2,200 mph) https://t.co/7HnBtFsx5z", "url": "https://x.com/WesRoth/status/2122538449362403506"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2122160994856374272"], "media_source_tweet_id": ["2122161629592953032"]}, "author_id": "1547403906954563585", "created_at": "2026-11-17T03:30:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122532683092049998"], "id": "2122532683092049998", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1858, "like_count": 27, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Qwen4-Max used about 105,000 output tokens per task on the Artificial Analysis Intelligence Index. Its predecessor used about 171,000. Both ran at xhigh reasoning effort.\n\nSo the new model generated 39% fewer tokens while improving on every test in the index. On HLE-Diamond", "url": "https://x.com/WesRoth/status/2122532683092049998"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2122408454384181248"], "media_source_tweet_id": ["2122408470813270314"]}, "author_id": "1618975370488999936", "created_at": "2026-11-17T03:29:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122532568931381696"], "entities": {"urls": [{"end": 302, "start": 279, "url": "https://t.co/qMNLgxvubH"}]}, "id": "2122532568931381696", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 76, "impression_count": 9105, "like_count": 113, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 16, "retweet_count": 5}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122411451092807926", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "This launch is pretty dope from Perplexity.\n\nThey just launched a webhook-based API for web monitoring. You can have your agents listen for new developments across the web, track specific topics or companies, monitor webpage changes, and get notified whenever something relevant https://t.co/qMNLgxvubH", "url": "https://x.com/ai_for_success/status/2122532568931381696"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2122352040081063936"], "media_source_tweet_id": ["2122352071295009156"]}, "author_id": "1547403906954563585", "created_at": "2026-11-17T03:00:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122525146258817183"], "id": "2122525146258817183", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 1918, "like_count": 26, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "Perplexity launched Frontier Research, a program to build an AI that can carry out scientific research on its own. The team will study how multiple agents can work together and how they can keep learning from new results.\n\nPerplexity says more than 10,000 GPUs will support the", "url": "https://x.com/WesRoth/status/2122525146258817183"}], "includes": {"media": [{"height": 2700, "media_key": "3_2122727905935654917", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HXVxyKQagAUyH_S.jpg", "width": 2160}, {"height": 2700, "media_key": "3_2122727905931460615", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HXVxyKPagAcNCbT.jpg", "width": 2160}, {"height": 2700, "media_key": "3_2122727905906298880", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HXVxyKJakAAH_ew.jpg", "width": 2160}, {"height": 2700, "media_key": "3_2122727905935654913", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HXVxyKQagAET_1C.jpg", "width": 2160}, {"height": 2700, "media_key": "3_2122727905948237826", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HXVxyKTagAIJXq5.jpg", "width": 2160}, {"height": 2700, "media_key": "3_2122727905931460618", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HXVxyKPagAoqXkk.jpg", "width": 2160}, {"height": 2700, "media_key": "3_2122727905931460609", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HXVxyKPagAESSTo.jpg", "width": 2160}, {"height": 2700, "media_key": "3_2122727906753544194", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HXVxyNTagAI-jTM.jpg", "width": 2160}, {"height": 2700, "media_key": "3_2122727905918943232", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HXVxyKMbgAAMZww.jpg", "width": 2160}, {"height": 1202, "media_key": "3_2122693427976605697", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HXVSbR2aEAEnw4B.jpg", "width": 2340}, {"duration_ms": 513700, "height": 1080, "media_key": "13_2122617316437577728", "preview_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2122617316437577728/img/Qp8EegwmvrqDz4kL.jpg", "type": "video", "variants": [{"bit_rate": 832000, "content_type": "video/mp4", "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2122617316437577728/vid/avc1/640x360/nt_ySZDoM8Y0sskA.mp4"}, {"bit_rate": 25600